    "body": "Follow-up #40796\r\nFix https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40796#issuecomment-5022399111\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nThe title is combined with window's attributes only if the title is a string (which implies the FloatTitle / FloatFooter highlight groups), but not when the title is text-hl chunks.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nCombine specified highlight group with window-local Normal highlight as well.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-21T15:45:45Z",
